Sub-Store Workers is a Cloudflare Workers adaptation of Sub-Store.

The upstream Sub-Store source is obtained at build time from:
https://github.com/sub-store-org/Sub-Store

This repository modifies the runtime boundary only: Cloudflare Worker
entrypoint and routing, Durable Object/KV persistence, QuickJS integration,
and build/deployment automation. Upstream business logic is not maintained
here. The deployed source corresponds to the upstream commit recorded in
`.upstream-sha` at build time.

